                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.28.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "28.13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Moses, “Leave this place, you and the people you brought out of Egypt, and go to the land that I promised to give to Abraham, Isaac, and Jacob and to their descendants. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will send an angel to guide you, and I will drive out the Canaanites, the Amorites, the Hittites, the Perizzites, the Hivites, and the Jebusites. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You are going to a rich and fertile land. But I will not go with you myself, because you are a stubborn people, and I might destroy you on the way.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When the people heard this, they began to mourn and did not wear jewellery any more. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had commanded Moses to say to them, “You are a stubborn people. If I were to go with you even for a moment, I would completely destroy you. Now take off your jewellery, and I will decide what to do with you.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So after they left Mount Sinai, the people of Israel no longer wore jewellery.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Whenever the people of Israel set up camp, Moses would take the sacred Tent and put it up some distance away from the camp. It was called the Tent of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s presence, and anyone who wanted to consult the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " would go out to it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Whenever Moses went out there, the people would stand at the door of their tents and watch Moses until he entered it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After Moses had gone in, the pillar of cloud would come down and stay at the door of the Tent, and the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " would speak to Moses from the cloud. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As soon as the people saw the pillar of cloud at the door of the Tent, they would bow down. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " would speak with Moses face to face, just as someone speaks with a friend. Then Moses would return to the camp. But the young man who was his helper, Joshua son of Nun, stayed in the Tent.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses said to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", “It is true that you have told me to lead these people to that land, but you did not tell me whom you would send with me. You have said that you know me well and are pleased with me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now if you are, tell me your plans, so that I may serve you and continue to please you. Remember also that you have chosen this nation to be your own.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said, “I will go with you, and I will give you victory.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses replied, “If you do not go with us, don't make us leave this place. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "How will anyone know that you are pleased with your people and with me if you do not go with us? Your presence with us will distinguish us from any other people on earth.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Moses, “I will do just as you have asked, because I know you very well and I am pleased with you.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Moses requested, “Please, let me see the dazzling light of your presence.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.9.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 9.15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " answered, “I will make all my splendour pass before you and in your presence I will pronounce my sacred name. I am the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", and I show compassion and pity on those I choose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will not let you see my face, because no one can see me and stay alive, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but here is a place beside me where you can stand on a rock. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When the dazzling light of my presence passes by, I will put you in an opening in the rock and cover you with my hand until I have passed by. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then I will take my hand away, and you will see my back but not my face.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
